    "body": "## Summary\n\n- document the repository's mixed per-artifact license model and include complete Apache-2.0 terms\n- reconcile ReuseFirst `v1.2.1` metadata while marking its published tag as a known-defective historical record\n- record actual release mutability and attached-asset counts for all artifacts\n- add a CI contract for catalog, licenses, live releases, and known historical tag defects\n\nNo tag or release was created, moved, or modified.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `GITHUB_TOKEN=\"$(gh auth token)\" python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -p 'test_*.py' -v`\n- `python3 -m unittest discover -s artifacts/reusefirst/tests -p 'test_*.py' -v`\n- `git diff --check`\n- independent review completed; all findings addressed\n\nTracks edoworks/factory#52.\n",
