    "body": "## Summary\n\n- Prepare an unreleased ReuseFirst `v1.2.1` candidate against immutable revision `30e588b4dc0d869da9b58a01d91c22d6f4931361`.\n- Keep the existing `v1.2.0` tag unchanged and publication approval false.\n- Correct provenance and add a candidate release note.\n\nThe candidate remains unreleased. Customer Zero evidence is maintained by\nconsuming factories and is not asserted as public artifact provenance here.\n\n## Verification\n\n```text\npython3 -m unittest discover -s artifacts/reusefirst/tests\nRan 3 tests in 0.000s\nOK\n```\n\nNo artifact code or dependency policy changed.\n",
