    "body": "## Change summary\n\nAdd the repository controls needed for reviewed artifact changes: a pull\nrequest template, CODEOWNERS, a review-contract check, contributor workflow\nguidance, and safe same-repository merged-branch cleanup.\n\n## Verification\n\n- [x] Tests for the changed artifact pass.\n- [x] Provenance is updated.\n- [x] License impact is reviewed.\n- [x] Release notes are updated when applicable.\n- [x] No credentials, private paths, generated caches, or unsupported claims were added.\n\n## Rubber-duck review\n\n- Reviewer: supportfoculoom\n- Review date: 2026-09-19\n- Review result: No issues found. The workflow is scoped to same-repository merged branches, requires explicit review evidence in the PR body, and leaves ruleset enforcement as a repository-owner control.\n- [x] I walked through the changed files and recorded every finding or explicitly recorded that no issues were found.\n- [x] I checked the artifact boundary, provenance, license, tests, and release impact.\n\n## Merge readiness\n\n- [ ] Required review is approved.\n- [ ] Required CI checks are green.\n- [x] The branch is current with `main`.\n",
